    <string name="about_wnt">Wasting No Time (WNT) makes Cat Care.</string>
    <string name="about_purpose">Plan everyday care, keep a history, and make time for your cats. Cat Care works offline without an account. Observations are not diagnoses.</string>
    <string name="privacy_storage">Cat profiles, schedules, care records and comments stay on this device. The app has no internet permission, ads, analytics, or remote crash reporting. We do not receive your care data.</string>
    <string name="privacy_files">Exports, backups and shared cards may contain private information. You choose their destination. A document provider or sharing app may store or sync them under its own policy. Automatic backups require a folder you explicitly choose.</string>
    <string name="privacy_delete">Delete one cat or all care data in Data. Clearing Android app storage or uninstalling also removes local data. Exported and backup files remain outside the app; delete them separately, including cloud copies. Android device backup and device transfer are disabled. Restore replaces local care data only after confirmation; it keeps this installation’s settings and backup folder.</string>
    <string name="backup_restore">Backup and restore</string>
    <string name="backup_description">Choose a folder once to enable automatic saving of a full care backup about once a day. Keep the 7 newest copies. Android may delay background work. Choose a safe folder; its provider may sync files. Settings and folder access are not included in backups.</string>
